      <h2>The Final Verdict</h2>
      <p><strong>Choose Marrakech if:</strong> You want luxury, incredible dining, vibrant nightlife, photogenic architecture, easy navigation, and access to the Atlas Mountains.</p>
      <p><strong>Choose Fes if:</strong> You are a history buff, you want an intense, unfiltered cultural experience, you prefer fewer crowds, and you are traveling on a slightly tighter budget.</p>

